.TH "FWD INFO" "1" "2026-08-12" "fwdit" "fwd info Manual"
.SH NAME
fwd\-info \- Print installed version and the local paths used for
configuration and session state.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fwd info
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print installed version and the local paths used for configuration and
session state.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fP <auto|rich|markdown|json>
Output format: auto uses Rich in a terminal and Markdown otherwise.
[default: auto]
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fP
Render structured output as JSON; shorthand for --format json.
.SH EXIT STATUS
\fB0\fP indicates success. Any nonzero value indicates an error.
.SH REPORTING BUGS
Report issues at \fIhttps://github.com/Sid-MB/fwd/issues\fP.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfwd\fP(1)
